### BASE URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:6060
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION (Public Routes)
### ============================================

### 1.1 Register a new tenant and admin user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@demo.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "tenantName": "John's Store",
  "tenantCode": "JOHNS"
}

### 1.2 Login (requires tenantCode)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "john@demo.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "tenantCode": "JOHNS"
}
### 1.2 Login (requires tenantCode)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@demo.com",
  "password": "staff123",
  "tenantCode": "DEMO-TNT"
}

### Extract token for subsequent requests
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
# @tenantId = {{login.response.body.user.tenantId}}
@tenantId = cmrspovg9000001mj0b1dp0r5
@userId = {{login.response.body.user.id}}

### 1.3 Verify Email OTP (use the OTP logged in console)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify-email
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "525954"
}

### 1.4 Resend OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/resend-otp
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 1.5 Forgot Password (OTP sent to email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "john@demo.com"
}

### 1.6 Reset Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "john@demo.com",
  "code": "654321",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### 1.7 Get Current User (Tenant)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

